    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Michael Gilmartin are delighted to bring this truly unique and impressive country cottage to the market.\n\nSituated on a beautiful c 0.96 Ha / c.2.37 acre site, the property enjoys stunning uninterrupted countryside views and offers a wonderful blend of traditional character and stylish modern living. Lovingly restored by the vendors from the original stone farm buildings, this exceptional home must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged across two beautifully restored buildings which are linked by a striking glass corridor.\n\nThe main building features a superb open-plan living/ kitchen/dining area with vaulted ceiling, solid fuel stove and original exposed stove chimney breast, creating a warm and inviting focal point. A spacious double bedroom is located off this room.\n\nA staircase from the living area leads to a spacious bright loft bedroom, which is complemented by large en-suite bathroom with bath and shower.\n\nAlso within this section of the property is a utility area and a family bathroom with separate bath and shower. A further bedroom with its own w.c. is located above this area.\n\nThe second building is beautifully connected by the glass corridor and provides a large dining room which opens into a wonderful living room featuring a picture window, vaulted ceiling and solid fuel stove. A door leads directly from this room to the gardens, where the breathtaking countryside views can be enjoyed.\n\nOutside, the property offers a range of useful additional buildings including multiple storage and fuel sheds, a workshop and stable, providing excellent flexibility for storage, hobbies or a variety of other uses.\n\nSet in a stunning rural location and surrounded by beautiful countryside, this is a property of considerable charm, character and individuality.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment and is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this unique property has to offer."
      },
      {
