        "Content": "\nKitchen/Living Area - 5.663w d 4.77d\nWood burning stove, vaulted ceiling, exposed beams\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.961w x 4.689d\ntimber floor, open fire\n\nLoft Space Bedroom 2 - 4.54w x 3.973d\n\n\nWash Room Bed 2 - 1.174w x 1.179d\nWC, whb\n\nUtility Area - 2.141w x 2.2d\n\n\nLoft Space Bedroom 3 - 5.321w x 4.00d\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 3.979w x 3.506d\nwc,w whb, bath\n\nDining Room - 3.863w x 4.252d\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.698w x 6.220\nTimber floor\n\n"
